<title>USA: Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association said Thursday that on February 23 it will redeem the following callable notes in their entirety:</p>
<p>    Interest	Maturity	 Cusip</p>
<p>	6.97	  8/23/00	86387RST0</p>
<p>Accrued interest of $34.85 per $1,000 face amount will be paid, also, on February 24, Sallie Mae said. The notes are worth a par amount of $100 million.</p>
<p>Sallie Mae said principal will be repaid at 100 percent of the face amount. Payment will be made to holders of record as of the close of business February 21, it said.</p>
</text>
